Our SimTalk code, which we call in a Method, looks like this:
print PyClassMethod.callMethodKw("vp", "getSumString", ["prefix", "Sum=", 
"suffix", "m"])
print PyClassMethod.callMethodKw("vp", "getSumString", "Sum=", ["suffix", 
"m"]) 
